== name: a split too close to an edge or a ninth window fails
-- size 40 14
-- keys
down down down down arg window
-- expect message Window too small
-- expect result false
-- keys
down down down arg window
-- expect message Window too small
-- keys
right right right right right right right right right arg arg window
-- expect message Window too small

